---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { sellerIdentity } from '../data/seller';
---
<Layout title="Terms of sale | Raising Noble"><section class="wrap sec prose"><p class="kicker">Legal</p><h1 class="h1">Terms of sale</h1><p class="stamp">Last updated: 5 September 2026</p><h2>Seller</h2><p>{sellerIdentity}</p><h2>Digital products and licence</h2><p>Our products are digital educational kits delivered by email or download page after payment confirmation. Your licence is personal, for single-household use. Sharing files is not permitted. Download limits are 10 per kit per 30 days; contact us if you need more.</p><h2>Payment and gift cards</h2><p>Card, Apple Pay, Google Pay and Link. Prices in AUD. Raising Noble is not currently registered for GST. Prices do not include GST.</p><p>Gift cards are valid for three years from the date of issue, the minimum period required under the Australian Consumer Law. The expiry date is shown on the card and in the email that delivers it. Gift cards are not redeemable for cash and cannot be used to buy gift cards. Any unused balance is tracked automatically until the card expires.</p><h2>Australia-only launch</h2><p>Sales are currently available in Australia only. Orders from outside Australia are refunded.</p><h2>Australian Consumer Law</h2><p>Our goods come with guarantees that cannot be excluded under the Australian Consumer Law. You are entitled to a replacement or refund for a major failure and compensation for any other reasonably foreseeable loss or damage. You are also entitled to have the goods repaired or replaced if the goods fail to be of acceptable quality and the failure does not amount to a major failure.</p><h2>Governing law</h2><p>These terms are governed by the laws of New South Wales, Australia.</p></section></Layout>
